                                                "sense_id": "ad1f7d6b-ff83-3840-bc98-3160c00c960a",
                                                "text": "You gotta be kidding me. Transvestigators are wild. Here I am just tryna find some Anne Hathaway movies and I see this. [screenshot of a Google search in which the top \"people also ask\" result is \"Was Anne Hathaway born a boy?\"]"
                                            },
                                            {
