                                                "sense_id": "ad1f7d6b-ff83-3840-bc98-3160c00c960a",
                                                "text": "No you can't always tell. Of the trans women I've known who told me they were trans I certainly couldn't \"tell\" when I met them. And the transvestigators just suspect every cis woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba8d4ba5-4e69-4abf-b2a5-9431b33838d7",
                                                "sense_id": "ad1f7d6b-ff83-3840-bc98-3160c00c960a",
                                                "text": "I've known cisgender women who were kicked out of restrooms by transvestigators. It's the most poorly developed of all the Bigotry Sciences right behind phrenology."
